  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    ACTS Common Course - MATH 2103.\n\nPrerequisite: MATH 1003, MATH 1113, or consent of the instructor. \n\nDescriptive statistics, random variables, probability and sampling distributions, estimation, hypothesis testing, regression, analysis of variance, non-parametric techniques. \n\nNote:  A grade of C of better must be earned in this course if being used to satisfy the general education mathematics requirement. May not be taken for credit after completion of STAT 3153.\n    \n</section>",
